 "about": "One typed edit to a world (GitHub #13412): spawn, despawn, set a column, move, rotate, scale, set a content cell, shape the land. Whole centimetres, whole degrees, whole percent. A batch names the revision it was made from. A saved edit is the domain event realm-authoring.world.edited.v1, one a revision of the dev lane; a publish is realm-authoring.world.published.v1 on the live lane. The API answers a state (world.state.v1) or a refusal in words. metaverse-engine/editor/world-edit.coax writes and reads every one; coax/web/api/worlds.c carries them through coax/web/api/world-policy.coax.",
